  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\left(\\mathrm{F}_{\\text {net }}\\right)_{\\mathrm{q}}=0$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad \\mathrm{k} \\frac{\\mathrm{Qq}}{\\left(\\frac{\\ell}{2}\\right)^{2}}+\\mathrm{k} \\frac{4 \\mathrm{q}^{2}}{\\ell^{2}}=0$\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/ZvOvFUXON_xQCFHF2M09zraYh8gPpGX6EQ5cMMGa20k.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\text { where } \\mathrm{k}=\\frac{1}{4 \\pi \\varepsilon_{0}} \\\\\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow 4 \\mathrm{Qq}+4 \\mathrm{q}^{2}=0 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{Q}=-\\mathrm{q}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$",
    "image": null
  },
